# XSH getpid()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.getpid.001
anchor     functions/getpid.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/getpid.html#RETURN VALUE
anchor     basedefs/V1_chap03.html#3.284
class      required
since      1988
says       In a child, getpid() returns the process ID that fork() returned
           to the parent, a positive value, and the same value on each call;
           the parent's getpid() (called before the fork) is different.
test       t/001-own-id.c
